<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Authors>Stephan Stapel, stephan@s2-industries.com</Authors>
    <Version>5.0.0</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>5.0.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>5.0.0.0</FileVersion>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Description>.net library for reading and writing OpenTRANS 2.1 orders and order responses.

The additional transactions will be added as soon as possible.</Description>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/stephanstapel/OpenTrans.net</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/stephanstapel/OpenTrans.net</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>5.0.0:
Breaking changes: the generated XML changed, existing documents can still be read.
- decimals keep their precision and are always written culture-invariant
- FVALUE_TYPE written in lower case, QuantityCodes.Unknown no longer written
- no type attribute on ORDERRESPONSE, schema namespaces for TAX_NUMBER, PRICE_UNIT, PRICE_UNIT_FACTOR
- GenerationDate written as set, ORDER_PARTIES_REFERENCE derived from parties if not set
- AUTHENTIFICATION written with LOGIN/PASSWORD, element order of FEATURE and ORDERRESPONSE_INFO corrected
New:
- targets netstandard2.0, net8.0 and net10.0
- LoadAsync/SaveAsync with CancellationToken for Order and OrderResponse
- OrderResponse: DeliveryDate, OrderPartiesReference, Currency, Remarks
- Contact.AuthentificationPassword
- reading of PARTIAL_SHIPMENT_ALLOWED, CUSTOMER_ORDER_REFERENCE, TOTAL_AMOUNT, BUYER_PID, CONTACT_ROLE, FORDER, FTEMPLATE
Bugfixes:
- crashes when saving default Party/Contact objects, partial OrderPartiesReference, phone numbers without type
- file handles left open by OrderResponse.Load(file)

4.0.2:
additional documentation

4.0.1:
corrected element order
improved code safety. some additional null checks

4.0.0:
Some breaking changes inside.
Bugfixes.
Documentation added.

3.0.0:
Error correction around email addresses in parties and contacts.

2.2.0:
adding Feature and more fields

2.1.0:
repacked.

2.0.0: full support for order response message
1.3.0: correction of net standard configuration in nuget package
1.2.0: converted into .net standard 2.0, made dates optional values
1.1.0: fixed bug in order creation, added support for all countries, moved to .net 4.6.2
1.0.0: Initial</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
